API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:34:28.3652586Z ^[[32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:34:28.3662732Z ^[[0m
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:34:28.3663711Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:34:28.3665539Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:34:28.3666209Z 
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:34:28.3666834Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:34:28.3669740Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:34:28.3670749Z 
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:34:28.3671573Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:34:28.3673270Z    if you are ready to continue.
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:34:28.3674007Z 
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:34:28.3675390Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:34:28.3677866Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:34:28.3679776Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:34:28.3681287Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:34:28.3681819Z 
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:34:28.3682363Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:34:28.3683041Z 
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:34:28.3683557Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:34:28.3684626Z    can use Nix.
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:34:28.3685042Z 
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:34:28.3685330Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:34:28.3685684Z 
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:34:28.3686184Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:34:28.3686861Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:34:28.3687545Z 
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:34:28.3687782Z I will:
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:34:28.3688164Z 
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:34:28.3688549Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:34:28.3689166Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:34:28.3689807Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:34:28.3690545Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:34:28.3690998Z  - install Nix in /nix
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:34:28.3691423Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:34:28.3691959Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:34:28.3692501Z    /root
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:34:28.3702501Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:34:28.3703489Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:34:28.3714685Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:34:28.3715611Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
