WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:38:12.8900058Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:38:12.8901269Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:38:12.8901877Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:38:12.8902464Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:38:12.8903110Z    if you are ready to continue.
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:38:12.8903496Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:38:12.8904061Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:38:12.8904823Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:38:12.8905308Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:38:12.8905631Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:38:12.8905790Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:38:12.8905967Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:38:12.8906214Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:38:12.8906414Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:38:12.8906771Z    can use Nix.
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:38:12.8906909Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:38:12.8906998Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:38:12.8907147Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:38:12.8907406Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:38:12.8907846Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:38:12.8910489Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:38:12.8910690Z I will:
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:38:12.8911070Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:38:12.8912029Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:38:12.8912897Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:38:12.8913472Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:38:12.8913869Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:38:12.8914129Z  - install Nix in /nix
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:38:12.8914372Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:38:12.8914742Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:38:12.8915194Z    /root
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:38:12.8926354Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:38:12.8927144Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:38:12.8937788Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:38:12.8938569Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-12T21:38:12.8938843Z 
